WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:02.001
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.002
-We're back from hiatus.

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.003
This is "Late Night."

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:05.004
And, now, we're going to get

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:06.339
to the news.

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:09.175
President Biden traveled
to New Jersey and New York today

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:12.978
to survey storm damage from the
remnants of Hurricane Ida.

00:00:12.978 --> 00:00:14.313
Then, he's going
to head to Texas

00:00:14.313 --> 00:00:15.814
to look into that abortion law;

00:00:15.814 --> 00:00:17.683
maybe drop by Florida,

00:00:17.683 --> 00:00:19.686
to get some folks to wear masks,
if there's time;

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.288
head to California,
help with that recall mess;

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:23.790
and then,
finish up the week in Maine

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.090
to kill those lobster zombies.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:26.626
Oh, did you not hear?

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:29.495
Yeah, every state
has something bad.

00:00:29.495 --> 00:00:31.330
[ Laughter ]
According to a new poll,

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:32.765
President Biden's
approval rating

00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:34.633
has dropped six points
since June.

00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:36.002
But then, it went back up,

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:37.770
then, it fell again,
then, it went back up.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.538
Then, it kind of fell again,
then it kind of just

00:00:39.538 --> 00:00:40.607
stayed down for a while.
You know what?

00:00:40.607 --> 00:00:41.741
I'm not being clear.
Do we have like

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:43.843
any sort of visual illustration?

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:48.047
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:51.684
It's so helpful.

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:54.420
According to a new report,
former First Lady Melania Trump

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:57.089
has only been seen publicly
once this summer.

00:00:57.089 --> 00:00:58.391
"Also privately,"

00:00:58.391 --> 00:00:59.725
said her husband.

00:00:59.725 --> 00:01:01.227
[ Laughter ]
We had to put his picture up

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:02.295
so people remember.

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:05.031
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:06.665
A diner in Central Florida
last week

00:01:06.665 --> 00:01:10.403
began receiving attention online
after it said it would not serve

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:12.538
anyone who voted
for President Biden.

00:01:12.538 --> 00:01:14.473
I don't know how
to tell you this,

00:01:14.473 --> 00:01:16.008
diner in Central Florida,

00:01:16.008 --> 00:01:17.744
but you already weren't.

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.245
[ Laughter ]
What happened,

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:21.581
you got suspicious
after somebody tipped?

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:22.749
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:24.817
Producers have announced
they'll delay the release

00:01:24.817 --> 00:01:28.087
of the movie "Jackass" forever,
due --

00:01:28.087 --> 00:01:31.357
Sorry, they're going to delay it
to next year.

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:33.759
Gosh, Wally, and I had you
put everything in quotes,

00:01:33.759 --> 00:01:34.927
so I wouldn't stumble over it.

00:01:34.927 --> 00:01:37.931
and this is my "Jackass,"
reading this card.

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:40.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:42.768
Producers have announced
they'll delay the release

00:01:42.768 --> 00:01:45.071
of the movie "Jackass Forever"
to next year,

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:46.905
due to a surge
in coronavirus cases.

00:01:46.905 --> 00:01:48.908
Though, that would've made
a pretty good stunt.

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.944
"I'm Johnny Knoxville,
and this is

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:53.746
going to the movies
in a pandemic!"

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:56.582
Billionaire Mark Cuban
recently became an investor

00:01:56.582 --> 00:01:58.918
in a start-up company
that is creating

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:02.121
artificial intelligence
versions of NFTs

00:02:02.121 --> 00:02:04.723
that have the ability
to converse with people,

00:02:04.723 --> 00:02:06.325
raising the obvious question --

00:02:06.325 --> 00:02:07.427
"What?!"

00:02:07.427 --> 00:02:08.594
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.594 --> 00:02:10.763
Amazon's medical business,
Amazon Cares,

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:13.566
reportedly looking to start
offering in-person visits

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:15.834
in 20 major U.S. cities,
and they're focusing

00:02:15.834 --> 00:02:18.437
on the places where people need
the most medical help --

00:02:18.437 --> 00:02:20.240
their own warehouses.

